al investing  especially value investing it's that you  understand the company and you  understand how they make money because  if you can't understand that kind of  stuff then you need to walk away so some  people do understand banking but most  people don't and so some of it so  sometimes it's best to just kind of walk  away if you don't understand how their  book value is  generated so what we're going to be  doing I think I'll cut off the video  here in the next video what we're going  to do is discuss how to build this  program that will visit the any stocks  key statistics page and pull the price  to book ratio for you and basically what  we'll end up doing is making it at like  a screening program like we'll say if  the price to book ratio is under this  number tell me so that's what that's  what you have to look forward to if that  sounds interesting to you then continue  on to the next video as always thank you  for watching thank you for your support  your subscriptions and until next time

